{{ 'section-custom-request.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- comment -%}
  „Отказ от договора“ -- the online withdrawal function (2026-11-03, owner: "start with 2 to 4").
  EU Directive 2023/2673 (in force from 19 June 2026) asks every online shop for a clearly
  labelled way to withdraw from a purchase online during the 14 days, and for a confirmation
  of receipt to the customer. Selina (also on Shopify) does it with a form of this kind;
  research in docs/legal/research-2026-11-03.md.

  It is Shopify's own contact form, like the Контакти and „Изработка по поръчка“ forms, so
  the statement arrives at the store's email with a subject line of its own and every field
  as a line. Shopify sends no automatic reply to the customer: the owner confirms receipt by
  email (the success message says so). The fields follow the model withdrawal form in the
  return policy draft (docs/legal/returns-policy-draft.md). Layout and field styles are the
  custom-request section's (its stylesheet, its classes).

  The page goes live only when the owner creates it in Shopify admin with the template
  page.withdrawal, after the return policy is published (the intro text names its terms).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- style -%}
  .section-{{ section.id }}-padding {
    padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top | times: 0.75 | round: 0 | divided_by: 10.0 }}rem;
    padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom | times: 0.75 | round: 0 | divided_by: 10.0 }}rem;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .section-{{ section.id }}-padding {
      padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top | divided_by: 10.0 }}rem;
      padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom | divided_by: 10.0 }}rem;
    }
  }

  .cj-withdrawal__notes {
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.8rem;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cj-withdrawal__notes li {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .cj-withdrawal__notes a {
    color: inherit;
    text-underline-offset: 0.3rem;
  }

  .cj-withdrawal__statement {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

{%- liquid
  assign form_id = 'Withdrawal-' | append: section.id
-%}

<div class="color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }} gradient">
  <div class="custom-request page-width section-{{ section.id }}-padding">
    <div class="custom-request__intro">
      {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
        <h1 class="custom-request__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h1>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if section.settings.text != blank -%}
        <div class="custom-request__text rte">{{ section.settings.text }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
      <ul class="cj-withdrawal__notes">
        {%- if shop.refund_policy != blank -%}
          <li>
            Условията за връщане са описани в <a href="{{ shop.refund_policy.url }}">политиката за връщане</a>.
          </li>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.notes != blank -%}
          {{ section.settings.notes | replace: '<p>', '<li>' | replace: '</p>', '</li>' }}
        {%- endif -%}
      </ul>
    </div>

    {%- form 'contact', id: form_id, class: 'custom-request__form' -%}
      {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
        <p class="custom-request__status" role="status" tabindex="-1" autofocus>
          {{- section.settings.success_message | escape -}}
        </p>
      {%- else -%}
        {%- if form.errors -%}
          <p class="custom-request__status custom-request__status--error" role="alert" tabindex="-1" autofocus>
            {{- section.settings.error_message | escape -}}
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}

        <input type="hidden" name="contact[Тема]" value="Отказ от договора">

        <p class="cj-withdrawal__statement">
          {{- section.settings.statement | escape -}}
        </p>

        <div class="custom-request__row">
          <div class="field">
            <input
              class="field__input"
              type="text"
              id="{{ form_id }}-name"
              name="contact[name]"
              autocomplete="name"
              required
              aria-required="true"
              value="{{ form.name }}"
              placeholder="Име и фамилия"
            >
            <label class="field__label" for="{{ form_id }}-name">Име и фамилия <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <input
              class="field__input"
              type="email"
              id="{{ form_id }}-email"
              name="contact[email]"
              autocomplete="email"
              spellcheck="false"
              autocapitalize="off"
              required
              aria-required="true"
              value="{{ form.email }}"
              placeholder="Имейл"
              {% if form.errors contains 'email' %}
                aria-invalid="true"
              {% endif %}
            >
            <label class="field__label" for="{{ form_id }}-email">Имейл <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="custom-request__row">
          <div class="field">
            <input
              class="field__input"
              type="text"
              id="{{ form_id }}-order"
              name="contact[Номер на поръчката]"
              required
              aria-required="true"
              placeholder="Номер на поръчката"
            >
            <label class="field__label" for="{{ form_id }}-order">Номер на поръчката <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <input
              class="field__input"
              type="tel"
              id="{{ form_id }}-phone"
              name="contact[phone]"
              autocomplete="tel"
              value="{{ form.phone }}"
              placeholder="Телефон (по желание)"
            >
            <label class="field__label" for="{{ form_id }}-phone">Телефон (по желание)</label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="custom-request__row">
          <div class="field">
            <input
              class="field__input"
              type="text"
              id="{{ form_id }}-ordered"
              name="contact[Поръчано на]"
              placeholder="Поръчано на (дата)"
            >
            <label class="field__label" for="{{ form_id }}-ordered">Поръчано на (дата)</label>
          </div>

          <div class="field">
            <input
              class="field__input"
              type="text"
              id="{{ form_id }}-received"
              name="contact[Получено на]"
              placeholder="Получено на (дата)"
            >
            <label class="field__label" for="{{ form_id }}-received">Получено на (дата)</label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <textarea
            class="text-area field__input"
            id="{{ form_id }}-body"
            name="contact[body]"
            rows="3"
            required
            aria-required="true"
            placeholder="Бижута, от които се отказвате"
          >{{ form.body }}</textarea>
          <label class="field__label" for="{{ form_id }}-body">
            Бижута, от които се отказвате <span aria-hidden="true">*</span>
          </label>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <input
            class="field__input"
            type="text"
            id="{{ form_id }}-iban"
            name="contact[IBAN за възстановяване]"
            autocomplete="off"
            spellcheck="false"
            placeholder="IBAN (при наложен платеж)"
          >
          <label class="field__label" for="{{ form_id }}-iban">IBAN (при наложен платеж)</label>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="custom-request__button">
          {{- section.settings.button_label | escape -}}
        </button>

        {%- if shop.privacy_policy != blank -%}
          <p class="custom-request__privacy">
            <a href="{{ shop.privacy_policy.url }}">Политика за поверителност</a>
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endform -%}
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Withdrawal form",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Online withdrawal from a purchase (EU rule from 19 June 2026). The form arrives at the store's email with the subject „Отказ от договора“; confirm receipt to the customer by email."
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Color scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Отказ от договора"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Можете да се откажете от покупка в онлайн магазина в срок от 14 дни от получаването на бижуто, без да посочвате причина. Попълнете формуляра и ще Ви потвърдим получаването му по имейл.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "notes",
      "label": "Notes (list items)",
      "info": "Each paragraph becomes a line of the list under the text.",
      "default": "<p>Отказът не се отнася за бижута с гравиране и за бижута, изработени по Ваше желание с камък, метал или размер, различни от предложените на сайта.</p><p>След като получим заявлението, ще Ви изпратим указания как да върнете бижуто.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "statement",
      "label": "Statement above the fields",
      "default": "С този формуляр заявявам, че се отказвам от договора за покупка на следните бижута:"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "button_label",
      "label": "Button label",
      "default": "Потвърдете отказа"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "success_message",
      "label": "Message after sending",
      "default": "Получихме заявлението Ви за отказ. Ще Ви изпратим потвърждение и указания по имейл."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "error_message",
      "label": "Message when a field is missing",
      "default": "Моля, попълнете полетата със звездичка и въведете валиден имейл адрес."
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Top padding",
      "default": 52
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Bottom padding",
      "default": 52
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Withdrawal form"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
